              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yimalile pepano. Nambo une Daniele wangamwile woga mnope, nipo ngope jangu jatesile mbuu, nambope nakumbucilaga yeleyi mu mtima mwangu.",
          "type": "text",
